---
title: Integration Test Pipeline
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant TW as west twister
    participant BUILD as CMake / west build<br/>(native_sim/native/64)
    participant DUT as zephyr.exe<br/>(DUT process)
    participant PY as pytest session
    participant SHELL as ShellHarness<br/>(UART pty)
    participant HTTP as HttpHarness<br/>(port 8080)

    TW->>BUILD: build apps/gateway
    BUILD-->>TW: zephyr.exe

    TW->>DUT: launch zephyr.exe (subprocess)
    Note over DUT: SYS_INIT chain runs<br/>HTTP server binds :8080<br/>shell pty opens

    TW->>PY: invoke pytest --device-serial=<pty>
    PY->>PY: device_ready fixture:<br/>wait for ready sentinel

    Note over DUT,PY: gateway prints ready sentinel
    DUT-->>PY: sentinel matched

    loop test suite
        PY->>SHELL: send shell command
        SHELL->>DUT: write to pty
        DUT-->>SHELL: shell output
        SHELL-->>PY: parsed response

        PY->>HTTP: HTTP request
        HTTP->>DUT: TCP :8080
        DUT-->>HTTP: HTTP response
        HTTP-->>PY: parsed JSON / status
    end

    PY-->>TW: pytest exit code + JUnit XML
    TW->>DUT: terminate process
    TW-->>TW: collect results / pass-fail
